{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":173718,\"title\":\"New Order\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"Three years after a biological attack wiped out 80 percent of the population, Dr. Cornelius Van Morgen, a world renowned biologist, chooses five people from the survivors to help him find a cure.\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/pGIsPBiZ5sHgi7Ru6cbOvLRcvnU.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bJJAfwtpyb2G1gX6aygN4PJfkhM.jpg\",\"rating\":3.1,\"voteCount\":6,\"year\":2012,\"runtime\":90,\"genres\":[\"Fantasy\",\"Science Fiction\",\"Thriller\"],\"status\":\"Released\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"IT\",\"name\":\"Italy\"}],\"budget\":0,\"revenue\":0,\"director\":\"Marco Rosson\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":1156442,\"name\":\"Marco Rosson\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":22383,\"name\":\"Franco Nero\",\"character\":\"Dr. Cornelius Van Morgen\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7jDXqw5bCxh9KemuxYZhkNhxEYA.jpg\"},{\"id\":1156440,\"name\":\"David Wurawa\",\"character\":\"Thomas James\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/m8kird9Y9LefnDhYujkT5em8hT.jpg\"},{\"id\":1156441,\"name\":\"Margherita Remotti\",\"character\":\"Alice Molina\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/eP659FUK1mq8PG6qWh96By9PBXS.jpg\"},{\"id\":5256,\"name\":\"James Kelly\",\"character\":\"Robert Lloyd\",\"photo\":null}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":8698,\"title\":\"The League of Extraordinary Gentlemen\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/kdAuVFP63XXxnb983ry2pLCKd9S.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/n3VpgjdOB1DkHSUe1DbFzV8ncpJ.jpg\",\"rating\":6,\"year\":2003,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"To prevent a world war from breaking out, famous characters from Victorian literature band together to do battle against a cunning villain.\",\"genres\":[\"Fantasy\",\"Action\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":15767,\"title\":\"Godzilla: Final Wars\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/21lWA4YyYppVnwAPOiBkGrt2FGr.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/irLLP6uZRB10P4bCGZMzlGB5p6c.jpg\",\"rating\":7.1,\"year\":2004,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Humanity finally rids themselves of Godzilla, imprisoning him in an icy tomb in the South Pole. All is peaceful until various monsters emerge to lay waste to Earth's cities. Overwhelmed, humanity is seemingly saved by a race of benevolent aliens known as Xiliens. But not all is what it seems with these bizarre visitors. If humanity wishes to survive, they must reluctantly resurrect their most hated enemy, Godzilla.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Sci-Fi\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":198287,\"title\":\"After the Dark\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/mTSBjTriWuvYp27dsTWF9hs25HB.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4BXGXTcfQ8n5PTX0YL0UDWQSdNC.jpg\",\"rating\":6,\"year\":2013,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"At an international school in Jakarta, a philosophy teacher challenges his class of twenty graduating seniors to choose which ten of them would take shelter underground and reboot the human race in the event of a nuclear apocalypse.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Fantasy\",\"Sci-Fi\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":9667,\"title\":\"The Jacket\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/bt89UfRhjAvJDAO9CWJnRFXAN3p.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/oMson3ThVDsgHUMbdFFyUdpLU2M.jpg\",\"rating\":6.9,\"year\":2005,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A military veteran goes on a journey into the future, where he can foresee his death and is left with questions that could save his life and those he loves.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Mystery\",\"Sci-Fi\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":10253,\"title\":\"Dragon Wars: D-War\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/rEpvqWGu08coDLUpcpiz4sMoDYo.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5WWqrUIGrCb1QvZtYVaSfZgUG8n.jpg\",\"rating\":4.6,\"year\":2007,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Ethan learns he carries the spirit of a warrior who battled dragons in 16th-century Korea -- and one day he'll find a tattooed girl carrying the spirit of that warrior's beloved. Years later, he meets Sarah and dragons soon descend on Los Angeles seeking out the two souls of the ancient lovers.\",\"genres\":[\"Fantasy\",\"Drama\",\"Horror\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":13836,\"title\":\"Race to Witch Mountain\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/5RBZsOKMMxnp8L6UmOiylKOw4yo.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rlEQAN7vPn0mUUaHFjfgtUOQRtB.jpg\",\"rating\":5.8,\"year\":2009,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A taxi driver gets more than he bargained for when he picks up two teen runaways. Not only does the pair possess supernatural powers, but they're also trying desperately to escape people who have made them their targets.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Family\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":354556,\"title\":\"Guardians\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/sGHAoGdxD9CeJxr1mvKHjgt8eqj.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3yBBjRBnw5WTdh936iaTCY9Em9K.jpg\",\"rating\":5,\"year\":2017,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"During the Cold War, an organization called \\\"Patriot\\\" created a superhero squad, which includes members of multiple Soviet republics. For years, the heroes had to hide their identities, but, in hard times, they must show themselves again.\",\"genres\":[\"Sci-Fi\",\"Action\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":14164,\"title\":\"Dragonball Evolution\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/sunS9xhPnFNP5wlOWrvbpBteAB.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5sXBW3XYwCA3FZxVoaIVI1hGOK6.jpg\",\"rating\":2.9,\"year\":2009,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"On his 18th birthday, Goku receives a mystical Dragonball as a gift from his grandfather. There are only six others like it in the whole world, and legend has it that whoever possesses all seven will be granted one perfect wish. When the arrival of a dark force triggers a tragedy, Goku and his companions are propelled into an epic quest to collect the seven Dragonballs and save the Earth from destruction.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":13025,\"title\":\"Diary of the Dead\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/tGktSJW5dPf8QIjmcqum4KOEZPZ.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/Gfk1gYXbEUKynbdTHza5DaPWS.jpg\",\"rating\":5.5,\"year\":2007,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A group of young filmmakers encounter real zombies while filming a horror movie of their own.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Fantasy\",\"Sci-Fi\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":20329,\"title\":\"Death Note: L Change the WorLd\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/aTV14kh4YVXafBZtyNjQ2GrWsNh.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/m4qM1XvABr1mVKWKohvHA7obLsY.jpg\",\"rating\":6,\"year\":2008,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"\\\"The human whose name is written in the Death Note shall die.\\\" After making the hardest decision ever, another serious case confronts L. There are only 23 days left and without his best partner Watari, L has to solve the case all by himself for the very first time.\",\"genres\":[\"Fantasy\",\"Action\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":354251,\"title\":\"Southbound\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ehXtB1jlMx8FBlsX9JLhSQkvlZp.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/31H6hObnaYoavamfzm2DWu7ofhc.jpg\",\"rating\":5.9,\"year\":2015,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"On a desolate stretch of desert highway, weary travelers — two men on the run from their past, a band on their way to the next gig, a man struggling to get home, a brother in search of his long-lost sister and a family on vacation — are forced to confront their worst fears and darkest secrets in these interwoven tales of terror and remorse on the open road.\",\"genres\":[\"Fantasy\",\"Thriller\",\"Horror\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":296271,\"title\":\"The Devil Conspiracy\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/gZCWgbIq2IBDRMJmdx5NeYbbigL.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/sp7MPK2K60LLd7A6zjHKsfgjFil.jpg\",\"rating\":6.4,\"year\":2023,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A powerful biotech company has breakthrough technology allowing them to clone history’s most influential people with just a few fragments of DNA. Behind this company is a cabal of Satanists that steals the shroud of Christ, putting them in possession of Jesus’ DNA. The clone will serve as the ultimate offering to the devil. The Archangel Michael comes to earth and will stop at nothing to end the devil’s conspiracy.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Fantasy\",\"Sci-Fi\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"O47hm-ldTr8\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"5sys2WJfIxQ\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"vxrdSLce5ps\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}